title: Recorder
---

Mum: The memory machine is an asset that is passed down in our family for generations.

Mem: Now you have recovered all the fragments, it is time to reconstruct.

Jade: How are we going to do so?

Mem: Open the Manual with R to reconstruct the memory. The truth will reappear before you.

===

title: FamilyPhoto
---
Jade: It’s a photo of a family. That child… It looks like me when I was young.
 
Jade: Then are those two my parents?
 
